{
  "title": "Juicy Roasted Turkish Fish Manti",
  "description": "A high-protein Turkish dish featuring roasted fish fillet and ferment-kimchi in a manti form, perfect for a midnight craving. This recipe combines the flavors of Turkey with the spice of kimchi.",
  "cuisine": "Turkish",
