      "name": "scallions",
      "amount": "1/4 cup",
      "notes": "chopped"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the wok over medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together fish fillet, ferment-kimchi, onion, garlic, and ginger.",
    "Add soy sauce and olive oil to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Roll out the manti dough and cut into small squares.",
    "Place a tablespoon of the fish mixture in the center of each square.",
    "Fold the dough into triangles and press the edges together to seal.",
    "Add a small amount of oil to the preheated wok and swirl it around.",
    "Add the manti to the wok and cook for 5 minutes on each side, until golden brown.",
    "Serve the manti hot, garnished with sesame seeds and scallions if desired."
  ],
